<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 209 AND 83-0 V AUSTRALIA (108) AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 209 AND 83-0 V AUSTRALIA (108) AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South</p>
<p>Africa were 83 for no wicket in their second innings at the</p>
<p>close on the second day of the second test against Australia on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 290 and 83-0. Australia 108.</p>
</text>
